 he Left Hand Monkey Wrench Gang offer a high energy “all Killer\, no fil
 ler” Grateful Dead experience every time they take the stage. Featuring 
 unique combinations of many of the foremost interpreters of Grateful Dead 
 music\, Pete and The Gang always deliver a well-curated exploration of the
  beloved Grateful Dead songbook!\nTickets on sale in April\, stay tuned fo
 r updates and save the date!
